      <title>中国AI大模型调用量连续十九周领跑全球</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai/post/20260907/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BDAI%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E9%87%8F%E8%BF%9E%E7%BB%AD%E5%8D%81%E4%B9%9D%E5%91%A8%E9%A2%86%E8%B7%91%E5%85%A8%E7%90%83/</link>
